    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Goofy Golfette: mini-golf where friendships spiral</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Goofy Golfette, a game where golf, racing and explosions coexist in a joyful chaos. You will face your friends in crazy matches, where the one who has the most points at the end wins...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To score points, it\u2019s simple:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blow up</strong> your friends <span class=\"bb_strike\"><i>(nicely huh)</i></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put the balls in <strong>holes</strong> <i>(the real objective of golf, it seems)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrive <strong>first</strong> <i>(classic, but efficient)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid dying <i>(it\u2019s better, but it\u2019s not mandatory...)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 NITRO, <i>baby !</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To reap chaos, you will need <u>Nitro</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can <strong>pick them up</strong> on the map or collect it by putting <strong>balls in holes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Nitro is the hot sauce of your golf cart: without it, you won't last long.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/438e30f37c2c254e15f2ecae44762743.poster.avif?t=1755653664\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/438e30f37c2c254e15f2ecae44762743.webm?t=1755653664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/438e30f37c2c254e15f2ecae44762743.mp4?t=1755653664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 ACTION <i>(and reactions)</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With enough Nitro, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash</strong> to avoid projectiles <i>(or just to show off)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot <strong>Charged Balls</strong> at your friends</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate your <strong>Special Skill</strong>\u00a0<i>(each golf cart has its own little secrets...)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/82dd6470ebb1c9d35060d11c457694b3.poster.avif?t=1755653664\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/82dd6470ebb1c9d35060d11c457694b3.webm?t=1755653664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/82dd6470ebb1c9d35060d11c457694b3.mp4?t=1755653664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude35 BAM, DAZED !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run into an <u>obstacle</u> or a well-placed <u>ball</u> ? Result : <strong>dazed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your &quot;Racing car&quot; slows like a turtle, and the <u><strong>wave of fire</strong></u> behind you is already catching up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 PROGRESSION : <i>style above all</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By playing like a boss, you will unlock:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Golf carts</strong> with cool powers</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 Wacky maps</strong> full of surprises</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Klaxons</strong> that make you laugh <i>(or not ..)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>23 Slamming Skins</strong> <i>(because swag is important)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/014e0a1651bf46a251418435c8abc5fb.poster.avif?t=1755653664\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/014e0a1651bf46a251418435c8abc5fb.webm?t=1755653664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/014e0a1651bf46a251418435c8abc5fb.mp4?t=1755653664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, ready to burn the grass, humiliate your friends and potentially play golf?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come on, put this game on your wishlist and you\u2019ll be notified as soon as it\u2019s ready!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>(this summer)</strong></i></u></p>",
