ong> with cool powers</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 Wacky maps</strong> full of surprises</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Klaxons</strong> that make you laugh <i>(or not ..)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>23 Slamming Skins</strong> <i>(because swag is important)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/014e0a1651bf46a251418435c8abc5fb.poster.avif?t=1755653664\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/014e0a1651bf46a251418435c8abc5fb.webm?t=1755653664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/014e0a1651bf46a251418435c8abc5fb.mp4?t=1755653664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, ready to burn the grass, humiliate your friends and potentially play golf?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come on, put this game on your wishlist and you\u2019ll be notified as soon as it\u2019s ready!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>(this summer)</strong></i></u></p>",
    "short_description": "What do you get by combining Golf and Baston ? GOOFY GOLFETTE, the game where you explode your friends at the wheel of crazy Golf-Kart ! Shoot in the holes for Dasher, Load your balls and activate unique Skills. Online or locally, only the score counts... friendship a little less !",
